WEBVTT

00:05:29.596 --> 00:05:31.556
And so what was the plan to do retraining

00:05:31.596 --> 00:05:33.316
since we know again,

00:05:33.356 --> 00:05:38.236
so many women in this country
are the breadwinners of their families.

00:05:38.276 --> 00:05:41.236
So when they lose their job,
the entire family suffers.

00:05:41.836 --> 00:05:44.396
So that was the Marshall Plan for Moms.

00:05:44.436 --> 00:05:46.756
We put out a full page ad
in "The New York Times"

00:05:46.756 --> 00:05:48.076
to President Biden saying,

00:05:48.116 --> 00:05:53.036
"In your first 100 days, as you think
about what you should focus on,

00:05:53.036 --> 00:05:55.196
focus on moms, focus on women."

00:05:55.756 --> 00:05:58.756
And, you know, that turned
into a couple pieces of legislation.

00:05:58.796 --> 00:06:01.316
Now two years later, Whitney,